# Generated artefacts. Prettier rewriting these is never right — the generator
# owns the formatting, and a reformat is churn that the next generation undoes.

# Drizzle owns these. The SQL is emitted by `db:generate` and the snapshots in
# meta/ are what it diffs against to produce the next migration. Reformatting a
# migration also edits history that has already been applied, which §13.2
# forbids for a different reason but forbids all the same.
packages/db/migrations/

# pnpm rewrites this on every install. Prettier and pnpm would take turns.
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Derived from tokens/*.json, never hand-edited. Gitignored too; listed here so
# a local build does not produce a spurious `format:check` failure.
packages/design-system/src/tokens/generated/

# Build and test output. Gitignored, listed for the same reason.
.next/
.turbo/
dist/
out/
coverage/
